37 ns, 156-cell worst path through forwarding,\\nthe execute-stage ALU, and the result register, and reaches only 5.442 MHz.\\nThe ALU expresses signed and unsigned quotient and remainder with four\\nseparate / and % operators. Deep combinational division is the strongest\\ncandidate for this path. Reducing its serial logic depth should raise\\nCoreMark iterations/second without adding instruction cycles or changing\\nthe e\n…[117935 of 121007 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:e8ff5e29811cf76f]…\n and near/far/saved source selection.\\nExercise taken/untaken misaligned targets, reserved branch_op values,\\nstalls and recovery. Prove the new comparator equivalent for arbitrary\\n32-bit operands with a combinational miter when tools are available;\\nthis supplements the unchanged CPU formal and cosim gates.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 204.69, \"delta_pct\": -8.39, \"vs_baseline\": 1588.86, \"fmax_mhz\": 85.844, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4193876, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3693, \"ff\": 1188, \"seeds\": [83.465, 85.844, 85.844], \"perturbations\": [[0, 83.465, 13], [1, 85.844, 13], [2, 85.844, 13]], \"lutram\": 32, \"bsram\": 7, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.write_value_7_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/redirect_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -6.981, \"arrival_ns\": 17.275, \"logic_cells\": 33, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T07:49:49.634326Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 11}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
