s BSRAM in the \nFPGA.\n \ndistributed_ram\n \nSpecifies the implementation of RAM as SSRAM in the \nFPGA.\n \nrw_check\n \nInserts\n \nlogic around the RAM to prevent undefined outputs \nduri\nng read and write operations on the same address, \nensuring that the functional simulation of RTL matches the \nfunctional simulation of the netlist.\n \nno_rw_check\n \nL\nogic \nis not inserted \naround t\nhe RAM. By default, this \nfunction\n \nis enabled.\n \n \nSyntax \n \nTable \n5\n-\n37\n \nSyntax Example\n \nGSC\n \nConstraint Syntax\n \nINS \" object \" syn_ramstyle = value\n \nGLOBAL syn_ramstyle = value \n \nGSC Example\n \n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
