els\\ncontain none. Thus divider latency is expected to have little impact on\\nbracketed cycles; dynamic instruction counts remain to be verified.\\nThe local history contains only the baseline retest and no prior\\nstructural attempts; LESSONS.md is absent.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Make DIV, DIVU, REM and REMU blocking m\n…[178149 of 181221 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:200976d37db96cf3]…\n reused by ordinary/illegal instructions, full fetch skid,\\nindependent/prolonged memory stalls, and wrong-path stores/M ops.\\nAssert sole-channel RVFI PC/order/trap/source/link correctness and\\nonce-only memory effects, with no added pipeline or recovery cycle.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 173.18, \"delta_pct\": -22.49, \"vs_baseline\": 1328.88, \"fmax_mhz\": 72.631, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4193876, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3901, \"ff\": 1283, \"seeds\": [72.147, 72.631, 72.631], \"perturbations\": [[0, 72.147, 14], [1, 72.631, 14], [2, 72.631, 14]], \"lutram\": 32, \"bsram\": 7, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.pc_next_2_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/tags_tags_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -8.861, \"arrival_ns\": 19.155, \"logic_cells\": 39, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 14, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T07:31:00.095834Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 11}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
