{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfor line in Path('cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl').read_text().splitlines():\n d=json.loads(line)\n if d['id']=='hyp-20260930-001-r9s0':\n  print(json.dumps({k:d.get(k) for k in ['fitness','fmax_mhz','cycles','critical_path','seeds','lutram','bsram','implementation_notes']},indent=2))\n if d['id']=='hyp-20260930-003-r12s2':\n  h=d.get('hypothesis')\n  print('r12 motivation:', h.get('motivation') if isinstance(h,dict) else d.get('motivation'))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"fitness\": 223.44,\n  \"fmax_mhz\": 93.708,\n  \"cycles\": 4193876,\n  \"critical_path\": {\n    \"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.write_value_14_s0\",\n    \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.fwd_rs2_sel_1_s0\",\n    \"slack_ns\": -5.763,\n    \"arrival_ns\": 16.058,\n    \"logic_cells\": 25,\n    \"modules\": [\n      \"clock_ibuf\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex\",\n      \"cpu/u_fwd\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"seeds\": [\n    92.907,\n    93.708,\n    93.708\n  ],\n  \"lutram\": 32,\n  \"bsram\": 7,\n  \"implementation_notes\": \"\"\n}\nr12 motivation: The champion scores 223.44 at 93.708 MHz over 4,193,876 bracketed\nCoreMark cycles. Recent timing reports expose forwarding through target\naddition and successor equality into registered recovery. Moving that\nequality into decode or behind EX/MEM lost clock speed without saving\ncycles. The r10s2 inverse-signature predictor instead failed the formal\ntime budget; it carried two JALR inverse operands and used a wider\nbanked lookup. Reuse its arithmetic-independent verification principle\nwith substantially less metadata and conservative exact-operand matching.\n\nFresh isolated probes on this champion also rejected RAM banking alone:\na four-bank 64-entry predictor measured 90.406 MHz median, while smaller\nbanked tables and shared-sector tags did not beat the champion. Preserve\nthe champion's existing table organization and recovery register.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
